2. Personal finance agent
Mission: Optimize your cash flow, risk, and benefit usage as a veteran.
Submodules:
• Cost-of-living monitor
	◦ Data:
		▪︎ National gas avg vs local
		▪︎ Mortgage rate avg vs your rate
		▪︎ Food basket (meat, staples)
		▪︎ Discount sources (grocery, gas, utilities, veteran discounts)
	◦ Output:
		▪︎ “You are paying X% above/below national/local averages.”
		▪︎ “Top 3 switches to reduce monthly burn by $Y.”
• Budget supervisor/admin
	◦ Data ingestion:
		▪︎ CSV exports from bank, credit cards, utilities.
		▪︎ Map categories → your budget sheet (Google Sheets / local CSV).
	◦ Tasks:
		▪︎ Update budget sheet automatically.
		▪︎ Detect overspend vs targets.
		▪︎ Recommend:
			• VA benefits optimization
			• Insurance premium reductions
			• Utility provider changes
			• Snowball debt plan (ordered list: smallest → largest, with payment schedule).
